              "wholeUnchangedAcquisitionScope": "Whole unchanged mostly independently planned AND actually executed qualitative/quantitative acid or dye investigation, substance-specific release, own raw logs/standards, endpoint choice, common-standard bias and calibration-domain/new-dilution transfer. No paper value replaces execution.",
              "compilerInputBoundary": "Only existing supported applicabilityOverrides.jurisdiction is used; course/stage/view fields describe placements and do not implement new compiler dimensions.",
              "practicalEvidenceBoundary": "All original actual execution, independent planning, own raw log/digital product/reflection and local safety-release duties remain. Synthetic numbers, author answers and old review metadata are not learner evidence.",
              "officialChoiceBoundary": "Concrete own route supporting already authored targets; no universal state requirement, personal theme selection or new runtime topic selector is claimed."
            }
          ]
        },
        "title": "Anspruchsvolle chemische Experimente selbstständig durchführen",
        "titleEn": "Carry out advanced chemical experiments independently",
        "description": "Die lernende Person kann hypothesengeleitete qualitative und quantitative Experimente überwiegend selbstständig planen, geeignete Analysenmethoden wählen, unter den Sicherheitsbestimmungen tatsächlich durchführen und nachvollziehbar protokollieren.",
        "descriptionEn": "The learner can largely independently plan hypothesis-guided qualitative and quantitative experiments, select suitable analytical methods, actually perform them under the safety requirements and document them transparently.",
        "requires": [
          "42391b16-bbae-5c77-84e1-d488e714167b"
        ]
      },
