              "sourceContextAndLimits": "NW upper2022 pp23-24 EF introduces questions/testable hypotheses; pp33-34 qualification E2/E3 requires own questions and theory-guided hypotheses, followed by separate experiment/digital/model operators. The complete supplied weak-acid and reaction-quotient theory cases are related own upper acquisition. Formulas/validity assumptions are supplied; no full acid/equilibrium mastery, execution, digital artifact or entire standard is silently awarded.",
